{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/r53nfv43jywuaid1x2achc8fay4j8yw.mp3","text":"我，呃，我该干什么？只要把这摞纸放进盒子里就行了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/89/8l9xncob2j7otlbeq9jiq4e3pc1up3s.mp3","text":"博士，在干活吗？我可以看吗？好耶！沙发我来啦~","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/16/g176lvr0yfolx3mxl3ujkfld1jj6yxy.mp3","text":"我可是超级强的，别说一个坏人，一百个都打得过。呃，一百个好像有点多......但九十九个还是没问题的！嗯！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/15/svlzu477az01sxx2j9qvswyu85r6ylb.mp3","text":"我在一个房间里找到了好多这样的小瓶子，里面的酱味道还挺不错的。辣？对哦，好像是有点辣，但还是很好吃啊，博士要不要来一点。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/96kzri5a5akn7a47anf2tsabvvmlg3a.mp3","text":"我的窝在这里，博士的窝在我头上，火神大姐的窝在我左面......好的，我记住了！再记一遍吗？呃，好的。我的窝在头上，博士的窝在左面，大姐的窝在这里......","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/sgja8n8ssne2onnra8sxpi9nrmpuw0o.mp3","text":"原来我是从这里出发的啊，那那那我之前走到哪儿去了？你又是在哪儿抓到我的？这个地图上都能找到吗！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/3xul3hk5pueuwvdtzrya84u6hb9bcjg.mp3","text":"我好饿，肚子已经咕噜咕噜好久了。我们可以去食堂了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/4hcaipyt7dhduoxadm9naxwiulkl6uy.mp3","text":"源石技艺的东西我不太懂，别人用我收集来的武器好像不会出现那些酷炫效果。不过你放心，只要我在旁边，坏人不会有机会伤害你的。我分得清谁是坏人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/gztf712kr3w3asm7zogsf7r4utjuqh8.mp3","text":"坏人们都是成堆出现的，好朋友却不会总在身边。所以多一把武器，就多一份力量，我说的对吧。那，背后再多塞一把锤头，好吗？标枪也行，真的很有用的，不可以不可以。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/qkbdjppd9zrk277lzso5lxe20jmnr6w.mp3","text":"博士呼噜呼噜的样子还挺有意思的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/hi6l5bqqmcsfyjq667xkvhg9n62ru27.mp3","text":"你好像还挺和善的，是叫博士对吧。我是刻俄柏，要是觉得拗口可以叫我小刻，以后就在你这儿待着了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/i4mbuwv1e9t0jvezm3mx90cpy24q4y4.mp3","text":"我在看，我真的在看！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/99/h9vje6xtipcfdaqdksiv1daj255b4wf.mp3","text":"这个小小的纽扣是送给我的吗？我别起来啦，好看吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/fgcjaw47bshx9h5z2076knz9co7zrgp.mp3","text":"一把不够，两把来凑，三把备用。只要武器的问题解决好，坏蛋我见一个打一个。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7c/1vovyc7mqiaqij9rn7y8mn85d0v0e33.mp3","text":"我都听你的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/oripumlkw4k7kjxs65cxef1vetbbno1.mp3","text":"指挥？什么是指挥？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/42xdfq4h94unqhwncr3k9iw650lvdtu.mp3","text":"回来能有好吃的吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/0n37rq35i4rgsm7fltx0icg5ee0u14b.mp3","text":"呼......好！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1d/ipwu5pvrbwccy3sbql29h8vzm99v9tt.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/buj1bgbolo76wa9dxrnr9kerczpdcq1.mp3","text":"我听到啦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/h4rbbori19vuxt2tnps12a72de1wq13.mp3","text":"包在我身上。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/ighxzbnj6kz6r7k08e6ev6p29qij4ge.mp3","text":"我出发啦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/tpmv9fbx92naiv5zrpvurvu3alxgghf.mp3","text":"嘿呀！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/i6kru4728f5dnua57q2alu5zgv7janq.mp3","text":"去吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/42/746yqx3t7r71ml82mma8djkuf47ramh.mp3","text":"哒哒哒哒哒！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/421w318z3wd7q9qmn9843vxxg05y3xu.mp3","text":"猎物快停下！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/ea91gg0oul4zjsa6r2dikyrvmgdsex9.mp3","text":"有博士动脑子我就轻松多了，博士你真棒！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/de/tkakkq9x07yxjh6jubx6dn9k8651c03.mp3","text":"对付他们只要砰！啪！两下就好啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/be/4jothcqrlb9vrk3eq217k11mtu1mxc1.mp3","text":"你受伤了？要我帮忙包扎吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/h1lrgpfi0gx3raa67c53lgzr4dt9our.mp3","text":"快走快走，晚了就走不了了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/9n8kv2y5552tw9y1zw73paeeyx1s5f8.mp3","text":"这个软软的，躺上去一定很舒服。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/am2zn9wpr1z28y3pn7y3dzlvroxapwk.mp3","text":"咬你哦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/i8uij9nuhb30itvkpcxg5ktm43p2zrv.mp3","text":"我能跟着你走吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/alrg0gkmn7m0ws3sifq1urp8st6amoi.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/9t2lw4n3vv8phprm4almylf4dd89p51.mp3","text":"今天是节日吗？是不是代表我可以不用干活了？那我要在这里待一整天！火神大姐烤了很多小刻形状的蜜饼，我都带来了，博士，快吃！要不然我就要把它吃完啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:b/be/fjflrxyw02ufr8bsdjus6pjvons8j3d.mp3","text":"博士好！嗯，是该这样说，没错。","alt":"voice_cn/char_2013_cerber/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/axhu9peeigcw34sk2aoypklavc8z3cd.mp3","text":"我，呃，我该干什么？只要把这摞纸放进盒子里就行了吗？","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/2i3vh6sc3runp0yku9bpq4ghkixsktk.mp3","text":"博士，在干活吗？我可以看吗？好耶！沙发我来啦~","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/55/njsserikuzai81jd3a8w8wn5h12s7aw.mp3","text":"我可是超级强的，别说一个坏人，一百个都打得过。呃，一百个好像有点多......但九十九个还是没问题的！嗯！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/sixye2vuemhke6haywzz9xvwizss69o.mp3","text":"我在一个房间里找到了好多这样的小瓶子，里面的酱味道还挺不错的。辣？对哦，好像是有点辣，但还是很好吃啊，博士要不要来一点。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/af/80d27gr2isgtqyikubblzsotbqkrbdo.mp3","text":"我的窝在这里，博士的窝在我头上，火神大姐的窝在我左面......好的，我记住了！再记一遍吗？呃，好的。我的窝在头上，博士的窝在左面，大姐的窝在这里......","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fe/hgh4harbdxd2as50iu8sy4j4b76e7fa.mp3","text":"原来我是从这里出发的啊，那那那我之前走到哪儿去了？你又是在哪儿抓到我的？这个地图上都能找到吗！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:7/77/q2vd1j4dizzn8b0vz9nkd7ke40525v3.mp3","text":"我好饿，肚子已经咕噜咕噜好久了。我们可以去食堂了吗？","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/icojuqdupz1qxic6kzw1wgxcuhc4dzs.mp3","text":"源石技艺的东西我不太懂，别人用我收集来的武器好像不会出现那些酷炫效果。不过你放心，只要我在旁边，坏人不会有机会伤害你的。我分得清谁是坏人。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/91/arfxp5zdgw7hpw8m2jptiwo0w90q9u6.mp3","text":"坏人们都是成堆出现的，好朋友却不会总在身边。所以多一把武器，就多一份力量，我说的对吧。那，背后再多塞一把锤头，好吗？标枪也行，真的很有用的，不可以不可以。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/68f3l3rf21137qyaqr2xxnqjepnxuwq.mp3","text":"博士呼噜呼噜的样子还挺有意思的。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/dr2a40emvc39taqmd87yjbzxwkj0j41.mp3","text":"你好像还挺和善的，是叫博士对吧。我是刻俄柏，要是觉得拗口可以叫我小刻，以后就在你这儿待着了。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/h1y559oy3yttfp248aglmgj5g2rfu1p.mp3","text":"我在看，我真的在看！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/34/4ndbvjr1pm7dljku9wwkqmf0eep26gg.mp3","text":"这个小小的纽扣是送给我的吗？我别起来啦，好看吗？","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/tnmckw0zo168ipbugdjnuyiapwdq6w2.mp3","text":"一把不够，两把来凑，三把备用。只要武器的问题解决好，坏蛋我见一个打一个。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/ccowp6e8ac43zbphapsuv310o84nob2.mp3","text":"我都听你的。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/d1zvxb8evgz4a1mtsz7dvq3ax8f7xde.mp3","text":"指挥？什么是指挥？","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8d/dcep3d8nn0ecp1olr00qrrkqu9kzrl5.mp3","text":"回来能有好吃的吗？","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:6/64/dgy0ej3jdir3ltj58zizpoot9brq0of.mp3","text":"呼......好！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/3ylk0jsgan5kepi0ki4x07em6zgbm3g.mp3","text":"嗯？","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/sep86mmbc5aqag9gswky3qzvzsy9z84.mp3","text":"我听到啦！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/mjgufoi97u8px2ownlaxlju88ev1lsu.mp3","text":"包在我身上。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/oervhb49tdksr8afab1z9fxfl7rxaam.mp3","text":"我出发啦！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/doyysx7noiltq3ek031xvqptcntwdqy.mp3","text":"嘿呀！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/2v12ex00bra0l7g09uchsmvyqiueusl.mp3","text":"去吧！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/dmi1zwaj3uw16zdq8edgwq9epv7wikg.mp3","text":"哒哒哒哒哒！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/08/ktgwv4z92io7svogprb9tsdvugaf9mp.mp3","text":"猎物快停下！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/19/qoa8ffwd10iq5g9525nvenh6thmm4lf.mp3","text":"有博士动脑子我就轻松多了，博士你真棒！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/po91otcsf864p4xoyar2b5ia38vjhj1.mp3","text":"对付他们只要砰！啪！两下就好啦。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d6/hxhm459cqu2qdmmok0kr5jkootlqf4b.mp3","text":"你受伤了？要我帮忙包扎吗？","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/kxvrkqghhlku01nnvohwrhafgg68206.mp3","text":"快走快走，晚了就走不了了！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/ryvc64yq6uzirh7hvtkduou22wsylt6.mp3","text":"这个软软的，躺上去一定很舒服。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:8/85/65jigujpdlpoqsani5al7c2kv5y8tc5.mp3","text":"咬你哦！","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/k0k0yf9m4deaalwie5kgmt24o3c3ez6.mp3","text":"我能跟着你走吗？","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/if8uvxijm4jdp2wy81599rqwql8r50a.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/iqiqa22ehrns9u38nyfhyi3cblkije4.mp3","text":"今天是节日吗？是不是代表我可以不用干活了？那我要在这里待一整天！火神大姐烤了很多小刻形状的蜜饼，我都带来了，博士，快吃！要不然我就要把它吃完啦。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/nyw5hdf4mlzv709lpz2al8tnj2e61sv.mp3","text":"博士好！嗯，是该这样说，没错。","alt":"voice/char_2013_cerber/cn_042.mp3"}]}}